    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "To calculate the percent change in the fair value of RSU awards from 2016 to 2017, we use the values provided: $71.46 in 2016 and $72.47 in 2017. The formula for percent change is ((New Value - Old Value) / Old Value) * 100.\n\nCalculation: (($72.47 - $71.46) / $71.46) * 100 = ($1.01 / $71.46) * 100 ≈ 1.41337%.\n\nRounding to two decimal places, the percent change is approximately 1.41%.\n\n\\boxed{1.41\\%}",
