      "generated_answer": "Guidance from Obi-Wan’s spirit helps Luke use the Force and destroy the Death Star. Luke relies on this spiritual guidance during the final trench run, trusting the Force over instruments. His success comes from combining intuition, training, and Obi-Wan’s lingering presence.  \n\n\\boxed{Obi-Wan's spirit}",
