      "generated_answer": "The technology in Ross' ship—faster-than-light travel—has been kept secret because it could enable one colony to conquer others, potentially sparking interstellar war. Its power and strategic advantage were deemed too dangerous if widely known. Secrecy aimed to preserve stability among the isolated, already fragile colonies.  \n\n\\boxed{It could give rise to interstellar war if one colony decided to conquer others.}",
