    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "McClane blocks the plane's ailerons with his jacket to prevent takeoff and then ignites a trail of fuel from the opened hatch with his cigarette lighter, destroying the jet and killing Stuart, Esperanza, and all aboard.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{McClane blocks the ailerons and ignites the fuel trail with his lighter, destroying the jet.}}",
      "success": true,
