      "generated_answer": "McClane stops Stuart and Esperanza by hitching a ride on their escaping Boeing 747, blocking its ailerons with his jacket to prevent takeoff. After defeating Grant and then Stuart in combat, he knocks McClane off the plane—but as he falls, McClane opens the fuel hatch and ignites the fuel trail with his cigarette lighter, causing the jet to explode. This destroys the plane, killing Esperanza, Stuart, and everyone on board.  \n\\boxed{McClane sets fire to the escaping plane's fuel trail, destroying it and killing Stuart and Esperanza.}",
