    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "\"In pace requiescat\" is Latin for \"May he rest in peace.\"  \nIt is commonly used on tombstones or in obituaries as a prayer for the deceased’s eternal tranquility.  \nIts abbreviation \"R.I.P.\" is widely recognized in English-speaking contexts.  \n\n\\boxed{\\text{May he rest in peace}}",
