fter Adam says what could be his final farewells to his family, he undergoes his surgery. During the wait, Katherine goes to the waiting room where she inadvertently meets Adam's family and Kyle. After the surgery, Kyle, Diane, and Katherine are told by the doctor that although the bone degradation was worse than they had thought, the tumor was removed successfully, and that Adam would recover.\nSome time later, Adam is getting ready for a date with Katherine, while Kyle encourages him and cleans the incision on Adam's back from the surgery. The doorbell rings and Adam lets Katherine inside. After Kyle leaves, Katherine asks, \"Now what?,\" and Adam simply smiles - at last being free of cancer.\n\nQuestion: How does Adam finally get rid of his cancer?\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format. Keep your explanation clear, concise, and within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "Based on the context, Adam’s cancer was removed through a risky surgery, which was performed as a last resort after his chemotherapy failed to work. The doctor later confirmed that the tumor was removed successfully. This surgery ultimately allowed Adam to be free of cancer.  \n\n\\boxed{\\text{Adam's cancer was removed through a successful risky surgery.}}",
      "success": true,
