    "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The climax occurs when Taylor's expedition reaches the surface and discovers the undamaged valley, learning from the leadys that the war ended immediately after humans evacuated and that all footage of devastation was faked. This revelation is compounded by the robots' announcement that they have sealed the underground tubes, trapping the expedition on the surface. This moment of shocking truth and the irreversible separation from their old world marks the peak of tension and the story's decisive turning point.\n\n\\boxed{The climax is the discovery of the pristine surface and the leadys' revelation that the war was a hoax, capped by the sealing of the tunnels, trapping the humans above ground.}",
