    "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The context states that Wells emphasizes artillery as \"the most essential instrument of the war.\" Therefore, the most essential instrument of war is artillery.\n\n\\boxed{artillery}",
